{"title":"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following equations does NOT have a solution?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5c50664ce09ee339598425619c37e9f17a35651.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\:(x+7)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b66f5b12cf1022b441699e00181e482a08ca1cbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}\\:|-3x|+5=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/0/c80d05e3ffccd51cd8db94d196312246a9eb8ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}\\:\\sqrt{-x}-2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7ebd85e123d9ba5a7f4f0803e3bacec54c9c41e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}\\:\\sqrt{x}-8=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/74702a4bb0654417ded3c6c68d31a6a771d84d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}\\:|-3x|-4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d4585d25446873cb275259748b872107c94b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-3x|+5=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> has no solution because absolute values only output nonnegative numbers.\n</p><p>Further:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab8c59f298443c24a48306f4cacbd01b2f2bb7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+7)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"21\" /> is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/6939833425734b3d8fa4a0112e06f226ff67b15f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -7$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1068da21bdfc4fbe5ccebdc3378f6efcb99d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{-x}-2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d924f912a4072521e9bb4c86d868591e01d0f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f8797d90aaf5c82eac2d06514229d6b25b9f0cef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x}-8=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065a6008b7a6b06f5d8b4e45b9be22d3eac01ba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08dc580f0d16cfe7c5fccc9eebe61109e014777c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-3x|-4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc416a63f2959766c39928506373ccdf33c5cee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{4}{3}, -\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72a08c9de59fb963e17912f4b2127a20340346a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Instead of solving, we can just categorize and solve.\n</p><p>Section 1:\nThis contains A,C,D as they are all squares or square roots.\nFrom skimming, we can get an answer as maybe C\n</p><p>Section 2:\nThis contains B and E\nFrom skimming we can get we can get answer as maybe B\n</p><p>Now we can analyze and we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> can become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52c6f440a0a502b9742ddfe66649ed66b834d8ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"11\" /> and absolute value inequalities cannot be negative, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72a08c9de59fb963e17912f4b2127a20340346a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9pG49ACG5k8\">https://youtu.be/9pG49ACG5k8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=biR0pgefTCs&amp;t=2s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=biR0pgefTCs&amp;t=2s</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A\">2011 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 199/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2320/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\n